msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Discard <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><if ($n2 > 0)> (Collectability Rating: <num $n2>)</if>?</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Выбросить <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><if ($n2 > 0)> (ценность: <num $n2>)</if>?</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 品質を下げる
#. de: Qualität mindern
#. fr: Baisser la qualité
msgctxt "Addon:154:0:0"
msgid "Lower Quality"
msgstr "Снизить качество"

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0><if ($n3 > 0)>x<num $n2></if>の品質を下げて次のアイテムに変換します。よろしいですか？
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Die Qualität <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 2 1><else><noun-de Item 2 $n1 2 2 1></if> wirklich mindern und zu folgendem Gegenstand machen?</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Baisser la qualité <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-fr Item 9 $n1 1 1><else>des <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 $n2 1></if> pour le résultat suivant<nbsp>?
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = number parameter 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:155:0:0"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Lower the quality of <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if> resulting in the following:</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Снизить качество <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if> и получить:</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 収集価値<num $n2>の<sheet Item $n1 0>の品質を下げて次のアイテムに変換します。よろしいですか？
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Die Qualität <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 2 1> mit einem Sammlerwert von <num $n2> wirklich mindern und dafür folgenden Gegenstand erhalten?</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Baisser la qualité <noun-fr Item 9 $n1 1 1> (valeur de collection <num $n2>) pour le résultat suivant<nbsp>?
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
